KNOWNBUG libstdcxx16 libstdcxx
main.cpp
--cpp20 --show-goto-functions
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
^CONVERSION ERROR$
dropped the body of system-header function
could not fully type-check
--
With the libstdc++ 16.2.0 headers (g++ 16.2.0), <format> lost the body of
`__do_vformat_to<_Sink_iter<wchar_t>, wchar_t, ...>': its default
template argument __literal_encoding_is_unicode<wchar_t>() builds a
string_view in a constexpr function, which the constant evaluator gave up
on.  Fixed with cpp14_constexpr_local_objects_of_class_type.  Runs only
with GCC 16 headers (libstdcxx16).
